    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45997" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sŭbo</span></b> , āre, v.
		n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>to be in heat.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Prop. of sows, <i><span class="en">Plin. 10,
				63, 83, § 181</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> Of other animals, <i><span class="en">Lucr. 4,
				1199</span></i>; <i><span class="en">App. Mag. p. 298,
			22</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			Of women, <i><span class="en">Hor. Epod. 12, 11</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Tert. Apol. 46</span></i>; <i><span class="en">14</span></i>;
			Hier. ap. Jovin. 1, 38; 2, 36.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
